{"about_the_game":"<u><strong>Fight through randomly generated levels!</strong></u><br>Fight through multiple randomly generated levels with the help of the weapons and items you find in those levels. After fighting through all the levels you can loop through the same levels with a scaled up difficulty.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979990/extras/Fighting_screenshotSmall.png?t=1689775063\" /><br><br><u><strong>Equip yourself!</strong></u><br>You can equip yourself with different weapons you find or buy in the levels. You can also find different items that give you different effects depending on the item.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979990/extras/WeaponSlotGifSmall.gif?t=1689775063\" /><br><br><u><strong>Fight your way to victory!</strong></u><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979990/extras/LaserGifSmall.gif?t=1689775063\" /><br><br><u><strong>Defeat bosses!</strong></u><br>At the end of the level you open a portal but a boss stops you before you can, each level can spawn different bosses to make sure each run is different.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979990/extras/Boss4ScreenshotSmall.png?t=1689775063\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Almost there!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1979990/6630ffd68af79b44a5045ad545d8890ec01eafd5.jpg"},{"name":"Saved?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1979990/4f0ec1ad7accab2b2660137a7ceb0db88b0c18e5.jpg"},{"name":"TOO MUCH MONEY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1979990/5715d46d4801340ddf6bcb24a4810146f6017a90.jpg"},{"name":"Almost there!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1979